<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEP" style="id">- Kwele Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Sefania</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sefania</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sefania</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sef</para>
  <para style="mt">Sefania</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chino china ulotezi wa Sefania. Sefania kalawa muna uwelesi wa mfalume Hezekia. Kalotela chipindi cha utawala wa mfalume Yosia, mfalume iyo katawala hagati ya mwaka 640 na 609 KK. Chipindi icho niicho chiwakalile Yelemia na Nahumu. Iviya isi ya Ashulu ikala ing'hali hainatekigwa (sula ya 2:13). Usenga wa Sefania uwasonhela wanhu wa isi ya Yuda lusita Waisilaili viwatekigwe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sefania kalotela siku ikwiza ya nhaguso ya Mulungu, yondayawataguse wanhu wa Yuda na wanhu wa zisi zimwenga zose. Nhaguso ino ihawasafyile wanhu (sula ya 3:9) na Mulungu yahawabweleze wanhu wamwenga kuuhami wakalile wanyendanyenda na wahole.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1:1 Sefania kolagusigwa.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 1:2 mbaka sula ya 2:3 yolonga kuwa Mulungu kezawatagusa wanhu wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Sula ya 2:4-5 yolonga kuwa Mulungu kezawatagusa wanhu wa zisi zose.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Sula ya 3 yolonga kuwa Mulungu kezawabweleza wanhu wamwenga wasigale, wanyendanyenda na wahole.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:1" />Mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu imwizila Sefania mwana wa Kushi, mzukulu wa Gedalia mwana wa Amalia mwana wa Hezekia muna zisiku za Yosia mwana wa Amoni mfalume wa Yuda.<verse eid="ZEP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi ya Yuda yotagusigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:2">“Nizavinanga vinhu vose muladi sekeviwoneke muna iisi.<verse eid="ZEP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:3" />Nizawananga wanhu na wanyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:3">nizawananga ndege na somba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:3">Wanhu wose wotenda mbuli zihile nizawakoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:3">nizawananga wanhu muna izisi zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:3">Niye Mndewa Mulungu nolonga ivo.<verse eid="ZEP 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:4" />Nizaitagusa isi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:4">na wanhu wose wokala muna dibululu da Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:4">Nizananga chila chinhu chosang'haniligwa kumtambikila mulungu Baali muna iisi ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:4">habule yondayamanye mazina ya wakulu wa nhambiko wake.<verse eid="ZEP 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:5" />Nizawananga wose wotambika kuna ichisuwili na wotambikila zuwa na mwezi na nhondo za kuulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:5">Nizawananga wose wonitambikila na kuilaha kwa zina jangu Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:5">mbali iviya woilaha kwa zina da mulungu yotangigwa Malikamu.<verse eid="ZEP 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:6" />Niye Mndewa Mulungu nizawananga waja woleka kunitambikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:6">wanhu wose walekile kunizahila na kuniuza mbuli.”<verse eid="ZEP 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siku ya Mndewa Mulungu ya kutagusa</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:7" />Munyamale haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:7">kwaviya siku ya Mndewa Mulungu ya kutagusa yahabehi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:7">Mndewa Mulungu kasasala nhambiko ya wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:7">kawasafya wanhu woyawagoneke.<verse eid="ZEP 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:8">“Muna isiku ija ya nhambiko yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:8">nizawatagusa walangulizi wa wanhu wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:8">na wana wa mfalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:8">hamwe na wose wosondelela vihendo va chigeni.<verse eid="ZEP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:9" />Siku iyo nizawatagusa wanhu wose wozumha chizingiti cha kaye fana wanhu wotambikila milungu imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:9">womemeza magayo na uvwizi muna ikaye ya milungu yawo.”<verse eid="ZEP 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:10">“Siku iyo uko Yelusalemu kwizahulikika ndilo kulawa muna ulwivi lutangigwa Lwivi lwa Somba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:10">giyogiyo kulawa muna ichibumbila cha habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:10">dizi kulu kulawa muna imilima.<verse eid="ZEP 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:11" />Lileni mweye mukala habehi na gulilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:11">kwaviya wachuuzi wose wanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:11">wachuuzi wa vinhu wakomigwa.<verse eid="ZEP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:12" />Lusita ulo nizamulika chitasa kudipekula bululu da Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:12">Nizawatagusa wanhu wailegehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:12">waja wokala kwa kutenda uhasanyi bila kudumba hebu kuwona chinyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:12">Nizawatagusa wogesa muna imizoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:12">‘Mndewa Mulungu hezatenda chinhu chinogile hebu chihile.’<verse eid="ZEP 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:13" />Utajili wawo wizahokigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:13">na kaye zawo zizakuwa matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:13">wezaizengela kaye, mbali hawezakala umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:13">Wezahanda mizabibu, mbali hawezakung'wa divai yake.<verse eid="ZEP 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:14" />Siku ng'hulu ya Mndewa Mulungu ya kutagusa yahabehi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:14">na yokwiza himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:14">siku iyo kwizahulika dizi da usungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:14">Iviya magalu wolila kwa usungu.<verse eid="ZEP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:15" />Siku iyo izakuwa ya ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:15">siku ya uzidilwa na usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:15">siku ya unanzi na uchiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:15">siku ya ziza na lugano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:15">siku ya mawingu na ziza totolo.<verse eid="ZEP 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:16" />Siku iyo izakuwa ya mhalati na madizi ya ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:16">kwa ichimu cha mabululu yeli na ng'huta na mhongono.<verse eid="ZEP 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:17" />“Nizawagalila wanhu uzidilwa na wezagenda fana viya wanhu hawalola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:17">kwaviya wanihasanya niye Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:17">Damu yawo izakwitiligwa fana matimbwisi na nyama zawo zizalagala fana mavi.<verse eid="ZEP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:18" />Hela zawo na zahabu zawo hazidaha kuwakombola muna isiku iyo ya ludoko ya Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:18">Mbali isi yose izanangigwa kwa moto wa wivu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:18">kezagala uhelelo wa wose wokala muna iisi kwa kusinhukiza.”<verse eid="ZEP 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEP 2" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Yuda wolongeligwa wasame</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:1" />Muiduganye, muiduganye hamwe mweye wanhu wa iisi mwilibule chinyala.<verse eid="ZEP 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:2" />Muiduganye ing'hali siku ipangigwe hainafika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:2">siku ija yohembelusigwa fana makang'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:2">lung'hali halunawezila ludoko lukulu lwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:2">ing'hali hainafika siku ya ludoko lwa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="ZEP 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:3" />Mzahileni Mndewa Mulungu mweye mose muli wanyendanyenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:3">mweye muzindilila malagilizo yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:3">Zahileni kutenda mbuli zinogile na muinyendenyende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:3">yodahika mwizakwikigwa goya muna isiku ya ludoko lwa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="ZEP 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowatagusa wanhu wa zisi zimwenga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:4" />Wanhu wa bululu da Gaza wezasegela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:4">bululu da Ashikeloni dizasigala matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:4">wakaya wa isi ya Ashidodi wezawingigwa imisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:4">na wanhu wa bululu da Ekiloni wezawingigwa.<verse eid="ZEP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:5" />Mwizagaya mweye mukala mumgwazo wa bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:5">wanhu wokala isi ya Wakelesi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:5">Mndewa Mulungu kalamula ivo na kezamtagusani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:5">Komulongelani mweye womukala Kanaani muna iisi ya Wafilisiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:5">“Nizamnangani mose na habule munhu yoyose yondayasigale.”<verse eid="ZEP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:6" />Isi ili mumgwazo wa bahali izakuwa hanhu ha kudimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:6">izakuwa na vizewe va wadimi na vikwama va ng'hondolo.<verse eid="ZEP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:7" />Isi iyo izakuwa ya wanhu wasigale muna ikaye ya Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:7">Umo wezadima wanyama wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:7">Ichigulogulo wezagona muna zikaye za bululu da Ashikeloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:7">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kezawezila na kuwabweleza fana viwakalile.<verse eid="ZEP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:8" />Niyahulika maligo yowaligile Wamoabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:8">na kwehula kwa wana wa Amoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:8">wawaliga wanhu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:8">na waitogoza kuiteka isi ya wanhu wangu.<verse eid="ZEP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:9" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi, Mulungu wa Isilaili kolonga, “Noilaha fana vonikala kuwa kweli isi ya Moabu izakuwa fana Sodoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:9">na isi ya Amoni izakuwa fana Gomola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:9">Zisi izo zizakuwa fana mgunda wa makombo ya munyu na masavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:9">zizakuwa hazinoga ndiya siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:9">Wanhu wangu wondawasigale wezazihoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:9">wanhu wa isi yangu wasigale wezahazi zisi izo.”<verse eid="ZEP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:10" />Mbuli izo zose zizawapata kwa ichimu cha magoda yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:10">kwaviya wawaliga na wawazeha wanhu wa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi.<verse eid="ZEP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kezawadumbiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:11">vondayainange milungu yose ya isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:11">Wanhu wa zisi zose wezamtambikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:11">chila munhu muna iisi yake.<verse eid="ZEP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:12" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Iviya mweye wanhu wa Kushi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:12">nizamkomani na zele jangu.”<verse eid="ZEP 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:13" />Mulungu kezagolosa mkono wake ubanzi wa kasikazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:13">muladi yawanange Waashuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:13">kezaditenda bululu da Ninawi diwe matongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:13">Iviya dizakuwa fana bwilingu.<verse eid="ZEP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:14" />Mabumbila ya wanyama wa kufugigwa wezagona umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:14">hamwe na chila modeli ya wanyama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:14">Bundi matuwa na bundi ng'hengeu wezakala muna imhanda yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:14">Madizi yawo yezahulikika muna yamazonzo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:14">Muna ivizingiti mwizakuwa timbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:14">mhanda zizasigala ziidumwe.<verse eid="ZEP 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:15" />Dino niijo bululu dili na deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:15">dodikala vinogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:15">Dodilonga, “Niye nabaha, habule dimwenga!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:15">Diwa matongo na hanhu ha kugona wanyama wa kumbago.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:15">Wose wofosa mumgwazo wake wojehula na wodizeha kwa kutingisa yamatwi.<verse eid="ZEP 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEP 3" />
  <para style="s">Wihi wa wanhu wa bululu da Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:1" />Mwizagaya, mweye wanhu wa bululu da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:1">mumemile mbuli zihile na mwambula mwiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:1">mumema ubamanyi.<verse eid="ZEP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:2" />Hamuhulika kuzumigwa na hamutogola kutegeleza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:2">Hamumuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:2">hamumkwenhukila Mulungu wenu.<verse eid="ZEP 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:3" />Walangulizi wenu walinga fana simba wotongoloma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:3">wasemi wenu walinga fana mbwizi weli na nzala ya ichigulogulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:3">hawaleka chochose mbaka imitondo.<verse eid="ZEP 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:4" />Walotezi wenu hawafaya na wavwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:4">wakulu wa nhambiko wenu wavitenda vinhu velile vambule mwiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:4">kwa kutenda mbuli zilemigwa na malagilizo.<verse eid="ZEP 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:5" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu yokala muna dibululu ijo kana haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:5">kohumiza voilondeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:5">Chila siku imitondo kogong'onda nhaguso yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:5">chila vikukunguzuka koifikiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:5">Mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wabule chinyala.<verse eid="ZEP 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Nizinanga zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:6">mhongono zawo zisigala matongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:6">Niyabananga makulugumbi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:6">muladi wanhu sekewafose umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:6">Habule munhu yoyose yondayasigale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:6">habule munhu yokala umo.<verse eid="ZEP 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:7" />Nilonga, ‘Kweli wanhu wa bululu dino wezanidumba na wezatogola kuzumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:7">muladi sekenizinange kaye zawo na sekeniwataguse.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:7">Mbali wanhu wake wakala wang'hali wolonda kutenda mbuli zihile fana ziwatendile.’ ”<verse eid="ZEP 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Nigozele niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:8">kwaviya siku iyo nizakwiza kulava usindila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:8">Nilamula kuziduganya zisi zose na falume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:8">muladi niwataguse kwa ludoko lwangu lukulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:8">Zisi zose zizatimbuligwa kwa moto wa wivu wangu.<verse eid="ZEP 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:9" />“Baho nizawabwelezela wanhu wa zisi zimwenga ulonzi unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:9">muladi wadahe kunitanga niye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:9">na wose wanitambikile hamwe.<verse eid="ZEP 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:10" />Kulawa kuumwambu wa nyanda za Kushi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:10">wanhu wangu wowonitambikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:10">wanhu wangu waimwagile wezanigalila nhosa.<verse eid="ZEP 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:11" />“Siku iyo hamwizagumigwa chinyala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:11">kwa uhasanyi wose womunitendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:11">kwaviya nizawasegeza wanhu wose woigoda na kuitenda wakulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:11">Baho hamwizaigoda kaidi kuna umulima wangu welile.<verse eid="ZEP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:12" />“Nizamulekelani wanhu wahole na wanyendanyenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:12">wanhu wondawanihuwile niye Mndewa Mulungu niwakombole.<verse eid="ZEP 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:13" />Waisilaili wondawasigale hawezatenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:13">hawezalonga uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:13">hawezawavwizila wanhu wamwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:13">Wezapata ndiya na kugona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:13">Iviya habule munhu yondayawadumbize.”<verse eid="ZEP 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila wa kudeng'helela</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:14" />Mweye wanhu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:14">imbeni kwa dizi kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:14">mweye wanhu wa Isilaili, toweni ng'henze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:14">Mweye wanhu wa Yelusalemu, sekeleleni na mudeng'helele kwa mizoyo yenu yose.<verse eid="ZEP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:15" />Mndewa Mulungu kamsegezelani nhaguso yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:15">kawawinga wehi wenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:15">Mndewa Mulungu mfalume wa Isilaili kahamwe na mweye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:15">Hamwizadumba kaidi kunangigwa.<verse eid="ZEP 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:16" />Siku iyo wanhu wa bululu da Yelusalemu wezalongeligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:16">“Sekemudumbe mweye wanhu wa Sayuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:16">na makono yenu sekeyabobe.<verse eid="ZEP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:17" />Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu, kahamwe na mweye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:17">Yeye galu kezamtendani muhume.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:17">Kwa ichimu chenu, kezadeng'helela ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:17">Kwaviya komulondani, mwizakala kwa tindiwalo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:17">Kwa ichimu chenu, kezadeng'helela kwa kwimba kwa dizi kulu.<verse eid="ZEP 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:18" />Nizawaduganya wanhu wowona usungu kwaviya hawadaha kutenda dugila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:18">iviya hawezawona chinyala kaidi.<verse eid="ZEP 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:19" />Lusita ulo nizawatagusa wanhu wose wombamanyani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:19">Nizawakombola mbetembete na kuwaduganya wanhu wose waimwagile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:19">Nizawatenda watogozigwe na kuhishimigwa chila isi iwagumigwe chinyala.”<verse eid="ZEP 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:20" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:20">“Lusita ulo nizamduganyani na kumbwelezani ukaye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:20">Nizamtendani mumanyike na mutogozigwe na wanhu wose muna izisi zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:20">Nizambwelezelani mateka wenu kuno molola.”<verse eid="ZEP 3:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 3" />
</usx>